<title>USA: Fifth Third Bancorp Q4 net, shr rise.</title>
<headline>Fifth Third Bancorp Q4 net, shr rise.</headline>
<dateline>CINCINNATI 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$0.87		    $0.76</p>
<p> Net			 93,615		   77,864</p>
<p> Interest Income	359,109		  313,316</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 105,882		  100,380</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr diluted		$3.16		    $2.83</p>
<p> Net			335,059		  287,685</p>
<p> Interest Income    1,384,820		1,173,165</p>
<p> Avg shrs		 103,994		   98,879</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: 1996 results include a one-time payment to FDIC of $16.6 million pre-tax, or $0.10 per share, to recapitalize the Savings Association Insurance Fund.</p>
<p>Total interest expense for Q4 1996 was $180 million vs $162 million.</p>
<p>Total interest expense for full year 1996 was $695.6 million vs $609.7 million.</p>
</text>
